      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if we miss the next promised milestone is Pioneer Freight Solutions. They are running a tactical PoC of NoiseGuard, a lower-cost competitor, and procurement risk is high if we miss milestones. The exact milestone at risk is the acceptance of the remediation plan for the taxonomy change incident, specifically achieving the acceptance criteria by 2026-05-14, which includes precision@10 >= 0.8 for facility lookups, entity-link hit rate >= 90%, and grouping false positives <= 5%. The remediation plan milestones include shadow index build (2026-03-29 to 2026-04-09), backfill and recompute index weights (2026-04-12 to 2026-04-30), and validation window (2026-05-01 to 2026-05-14). Failure to meet these milestones risks procurement extending NoiseGuard usage and reducing scope with Northstar [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_ac8afb52f2d3].",
